&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is within &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Goat Agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will be instrumental in &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;helping global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes from tactical activations to long-term partnerships, designed to drive awareness,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;engagement &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot;&gt;and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW221406265 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Campaign Executive, you will play an important role in the success of our influencer marketing campaigns. You will assist in the end-to-end execution of campaigns, from concept through to delivery, ensuring that each project meets its objectives and delivers excellent results for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of influencer marketing campaigns, ensuring seamless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling proposals for prospective clients, leveraging expertise in influencers and creative strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Account Managers in client communications and play a key role in client presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign success by managing KPIs, budgets across multiple campaigns, and delivering exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide in-depth campaign reports and work with Account Managers to maintain strong client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the delivery of influencer marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years&#39; relevant experience in planning and executing influencer campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in delegating and prioritising a constantly changing workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively and calmly under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of influencer marketing and social metrics (impressions, reach, engagements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reside within London or within a commutable distance to our London office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media: Sports &amp;amp; Entertainment is our dedicated practice focused on the development of brand partnerships, sponsorships, branded entertainment and socially driven content solutions for brands. We work with the biggest and most impactful brands, platforms, IP, rights holders, talent and creators to drive our work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We passionately believe that Sports and Entertainment make modern culture. Across sport, music, fashion, gaming and entertainment, they fuel the communities and fandoms that drive audiences and power brand differentiation. The vision of our 100+ dedicated craft experts is simple – &lt;strong&gt;We make brands epic in culture&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP 650&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an award-winning team at the heart of UK government, where your work will genuinely shape lives. As part of WPP 650 you’ll be part of a supportive, collaborative environment that values curiosity, kindness, and growth. Together, we use behaviour change principles to design smarter services, influence better decisions, and help millions of people across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Named WPP 650, after the 650 UK parliamentary constituencies, the name is a reminder that our work must reflect the full breadth of the country, every community, every audience. No two days are the same. The challenges are complex, the problems worth solving, and the learning constant. You’ll tackle issues that matter, alongside talented colleagues who care deeply about what they do. It’s demanding – but always rewarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is meaningful work with real-world impact – the kind you can point to with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the best projects are down to the people that lead them and the environment that they create. Our project delivery team in Sports &amp;amp; Entertainment is full of delivery specialists who take the time and effort to build both strong relationships with stakeholders and vibrant cultures that enable project teams to deliver great work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Media Partnerships &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our dynamic Delivery Team. This exciting role involves managing and overseeing the production and execution of content partnership campaigns.&amp;nbsp; Whilst this role will be aligned to WPP 650 there is the opportunity to work across a diverse portfolio of high-profile clients and media partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While the primary focus is on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Media Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Print, Radio, Digital), there’s potential to work across on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Branded Entertainment projects&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(AV, AFP, etc.) and &lt;strong&gt;Sports Projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of our Project Delivery team, responsible for the delivery of exciting projects, for WPP 650 and the wider WPP client portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Project Management skills to deliver a best-in-class project delivery experience for all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an ability to build strong relationships through emotional intelligence and great communication, problem-solving, collaboration and strategic thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for day-to-day management of multiple projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build ongoing commitment from stakeholders and bring people together to achieve specified outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery to include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning what work needs to be done;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Looking at the risks involved in a particular project and managing these risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making sure the work is done to the right standard;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivating the team of people involved in the project;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinating work done by different people;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making sure the project is running on time and to budget;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calmly dealing with changes to the project as and when necessary;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making sure the project delivers the expected outcomes and benefits;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasion and Influence - Uses a variety of skills to create discussion, reach an agreement and create outcomes, affecting the action, behaviours, and opinions of others.​​​​​​​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1/2 years’ experience at Exec/Associate level, in a media agency or media owner.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good Knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;all media channels&lt;/strong&gt;, including print, radio, and digital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;content, partnerships, and production processes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantageous to have knowledge &amp;amp; experience of AV, Broadcast Sponsorship &amp;amp; APF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hyper-organised&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with excellent project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional people skills, confident in managing clients and multiple stakeholder relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing &lt;strong&gt;commercial awareness&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience in financial processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and comfort working with numbers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;prioritise workloads&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and juggle multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident communicator, capable of leading client meetings and delivering presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive, enthusiastic, and creative&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– a natural problem-solver and a “yes” person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively under pressure and to deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2990 - Senior Associate, AV - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;EssenceMediacom:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom is a new breed of media agency. Grounded in analytics &amp;amp; insights and powered by data &amp;amp; technology, we believe in the power of media and creative to drive breakthroughs for the world’s best brands. We help clients understand the modern marketing paradox and discover the breakthroughs brands need to win with their consumers. We are designed for the new communications economy — built on data &amp;amp; technology, built for people &amp;amp; algorithms, built around diverse schools of thought, built to test &amp;amp; learn at scale, and, crucially, built to evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a diligent AV Buyer to work across Reckitts. The successful candidate will be working closely with the Implementation, Investment and Communications Planning teams to deliver best in class AV campaigns, whilst ensuring the buying delivers against price and quality guarantees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The majority of your time will be spent communicating with the TV sales houses, managing TV airtime to ensure you deliver in line with plan. You will manage the delivery of airtime at an overall level (volume), but also looking after quality, ensuring you access more than your fair share of peak, PIBs and centres.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to this you will be given the opportunity to learn how we plan AV media, eventually progressing into a role which has client exposure, making recommendations in answer to their business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the AV team, you will be a vital part of the breakthrough thinking at the agency, which leads our planning process. Understanding and developing AV and the digital transformation is fundamental to us delivering brilliant work for our clients and is behind much of our award-winning work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In three months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A full understanding of all the key investment tools across AV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built a strong working relationship with the other individuals within AV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gained a good understanding of the client businesses which you will oversee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the delivery of all AV plans on time and without errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a solid grasp of all the commercial aspects of your role (clients’ businesses and ours).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In six months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how the management of airtime ladders up to the audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implemented a robust airtime management process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built strong working relationships with all key stakeholders internally and externally, this includes key client contacts, Comms Planners and Investment Leads within our Business Unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered consistent campaigns vs plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to lead the management of campaigns with minimal input from the Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To form an opinion on the overall investment approach, guiding media outside TV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate, enthusiastic, curious AV specialist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No prior experience in an agency or AV is necessary, but valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong math skills are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communicator and strong presenter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone passionate about the opportunities that come from AV, data and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in marketing theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3134 - Associate Director, Planning - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Openmind:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Openmind, part of WPP, is an integrated agency model drawing on talent from across WPP. It has been created to accelerate the European transformation for Nestlé’s media function. Core to the solution is the advanced best data and technology capabilities, fuelled by WPP’s investment in AI, to maximise the impact of Nestlé media investment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Account Director, you are critical to the delivery of this ambition; working closely with the Senior Associate Director, you will be a key interface for our clients and lead planning projects from start to finish, acting as the conduit who brings together our specialists to deliver exceptional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee the day-to-day running of the account, ensuring flow and accuracy of work and that the campaign management process follows best practice. You are across all communications and establish yourself as the first port of call for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build a strong relationship with your clients and become a trusted strategic partner – showing a deep understanding of your clients’ business and how communications can drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong management and client relationship skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management skills to support AD in the management and development of Planners and Execs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution focused mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm, curiosity, and a team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated; an ambition to make the ordinary extraordinary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thirst to learn – be that the client’s business, people, brands, industry, trends etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to prioritise and delegate, as well as manage both up and down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic and self-aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to drive business results for both client &amp;amp; OpenMind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, proactive approach to problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate verbal and written feedback and instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2897 - Associate Director, Clients - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Account Director to join the Universal UK team– working across UK theatrical film releases. The role sits within EssenceMediacom’s specialist entertainment department – TED.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will have regular client contact from the outset and be exposed to all media disciplines, each of which play a role on our plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who does the role report into? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Senior Associate Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the 3 best things about the job?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be surrounded by people that love Film, love working together and enjoy contributing to the ongoing success of the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be pushed to learn and improve every single day and contribute to this ethos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The account provides ample opportunity for autonomy and direct client access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the measures of success?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to comfortably and consistently deliver high-quality work across multiple live briefs at various different stages in the campaign cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can take complete ownership of developing strategic and implementational frameworks, responses to briefs, campaign laydowns and PCAs across varying budget levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about the development and management of junior members of the team; you will be responsible for their success, growth and work-life enjoyment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the strong working relationship we have with our specialist teams (AV, OOH &amp;amp; Digital) who are a key component of our success as a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen demonstrated through the adherence and continuation of EssenceMediacom’s best financial practices on the accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of the billing process on a monthly basis with the help of EM finance team as well as Universal finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing larger scale releases, specifically managing larger partnership conversations with media owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive client feedback – our clients are incredibly collaborative and want us to challenge them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What would you expect to achieve in the first 3 months?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain the trust and respect of our local clients, working through live briefs and campaigns. Our clients are experts in their field and passionate about their products and the wider film industry; they expect to be challenged by our team in order to get to the best outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate into the team dynamic – we are strongly motivated by the success of everyone in the team and enjoy working together. Positively contribute to values and culture of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a comprehensive understanding of the film and wider media landscape, the complexity of the different audience segments and how this impacts the way in which we plan media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a positive working relationship with our specialists in TED as well as the Global and Central MediaCom teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in film is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong online and offline channel planning experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An unflappable, positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to see the whole team succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive under pressure: both businesses are high volume, short turn around types of account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deal with regular [often urgent] adhoc requests, an enjoyment for troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2617 - Analytics Associate Director - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media collective, bringing together the best platforms, people, and partners to create limitless opportunities for growth in a world where media is everywhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is within the Data, Tech, and Analytics (DTA) team, within the Global Client Solutions organisation. The Global Client Solutions (GCS) team is responsible for all global clients within WPP. DTA is responsible for servicing clients with best-in-class data solutions, data strategy, analytics, technology and AI solutions to drive client growth. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of the things we&#39;d like you to do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Analytics Application:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and apply a deep understanding of marketing objectives to support Account teams with comprehensive measurement and testing plans. To help deliver &quot;best in class&quot; analytical capabilities across the agency with the wider Analytics team, including the use of new methods, techniques, tools and systems. Managing the process through to delivery and taking ownership of global roll out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Business Effectiveness: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the creation of clear, robust and thought-provoking campaign reviews and insights, and show the wider team/clients how to improve effectiveness. Deliver insightful campaign reviews with actionable recommendations to improve marketing effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement frameworks &amp;amp; Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop deep understanding of marketing platform testing and targeting abilities, and act in a consultative capacity in their implementation. Provide actionable insights and design experiments to optimise campaign performance - focusing on brand and conversion lift studies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build trusted relationships with senior client marketing, analytics, and data leads, acting as a knowledgeable and credible day-to-day strategic partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage relationships with data engineering teams and set automation strategies to integrate new tools and solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the commercial health of your client account by contributing to the scoping and delivery of high-value analytics projects. Participate in new business pitches, helping to develop data and tech solutions that demonstrate the value of WPP Media’s capabilities. Coordinate with third-party vendors for the assessment and management of bespoke measurement solutions, including contracts and SOWs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leaderhsip:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex data concepts for stakeholders and contribute to the company&#39;s data strategy, promoting data-driven innovation within the media industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Analytics Associate Director to join our growing Analytics &amp;amp; Data Science team, reporting into the Data Tech and Analytics global lead. The team focuses on media effectiveness measurement, campaign analysis and client communication to help make brands become more valuable to the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be working with a leading advertiser, JLR, to harness their data and improve the performance of their campaigns, developing and deploying media measurement solutions. Communication with client stakeholders and effective management of assigned tasks is critical in this role. You will be joining an award winning team, with more than 16 tech and media industry awards to our name, including Campaign Magazine&#39;s Tech Awards Agency of the Year, Best Use of AI, and Breakthrough Tech as Part of a Campaign awards.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have invested in giving you the tools to make you as successful as possible, including training/development, full access to Google Cloud Platform and a wider global community of analysts and data scientists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It&#39;s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media&#39;s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be highly numerate: able to confidently interpret data and apply statistical tests to draw robust conclusions. Holding a degree(s) in a quantitative field: Statistics, Mathematics, Economics, Engineering, Physical Science or Computer Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analytics, measurement, data science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of applying measurement to media campaigns through Meta/Google, through brand and conversion lift studies, matched market tests or otherwise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-developed problem-solving skills and the ability to think critically and creatively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of statistics including hypothesis testing, descriptive statistics and distribution theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to present complex ideas to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently and as part of a cross-functional team, using project management tools such as Jira/Trello. Ability to project manage analytics projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly capable at presenting data in a visually engaging and insightful manner that cuts through the noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentorship and management, ability to display empathy in difficult situations and lead by example&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and advancements in data science and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL &amp;amp; R/Python, including understanding of packages such as pandas, numpy, scipy &amp;amp; matplotlib.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of what data points can be collected and analysed in a digital campaign, and how each data point should be analysed. Including knowledge of media data and incremental measurement, including both Direct Response and Brand campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of advanced measurement tools including MMM, MTA, Sales Lift, and Brand Studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media and all its affiliates embrace and celebrate diversity, inclusivity, and equal opportunity. We are committed to building a team that represents a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. We are a worldwide media agency network that represents global clients. The more inclusive we are, the greater work we can create.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy, part of WPP, has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity – innovating at the intersections of its advertising, public relations, relationship design, consulting, and health capabilities with experts collaborating seamlessly across over 120 offices in nearly 90 countries. Ogilvy currently &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-rankings-third-straight-year&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt; as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is a WPP company (NYSE: WPP). For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31Se_7mxpVA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/twitter.com/ogilvy__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SccaJbNMQ$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.instagram.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31SfRZhifmA$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.facebook.com/ogilvy/__;!!FMox2LFwyA!4Z5sYRsQCsdV4dIxzo5cqM97oclKST23C6w0s209mLcXxT5_tuCL0fM31ScfS6rLGg$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Director&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Consumer PR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department: &lt;/strong&gt;Consumer PR &amp;amp; Influence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Fixed-Term 12-Months&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Time/Part time:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting into: &lt;/strong&gt;Business Director / Client Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented individual to join our team as an Account Director on a large technology account. You’ll spearhead high-impact PR campaigns and run a fast-paced press office that spans both consumer and corporate remits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a natural problem solver who thrives on challenge and builds instinctive, collaborative relationships across different agency Capabilities and Crafts. Combining a deep understanding of strategy with flawless execution, you will ensure the team constantly delivers creative, quality work that moves the needle for our client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ of PR experience, ideally with a “corpsumer” background&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in consumer tech and the evolving world of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the UK media landscape and established journalist relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of managing fast-paced press offices and navigating complex, multi-stakeholder projects spanning consumer, corporate and policy remits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established as a trusted advisor to mid-level clients, with a strong grasp of their business context, challenges and goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural problem-solver who looks at briefs from unexpected angles and pushes for innovative ways to sell in and execute work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership of large projects and is accountable for both work and process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empowering mentor who guides junior team members, manages up effectively, and fosters a collaborative team culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute, with experience managing budgets, scoping work, and resource planning to hit targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients, becoming a trusted partner and advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the fast-paced press office function, and projects across consumer, corporate and policy remits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end delivery of projects, from briefing, scoping and resourcing to execution and measurement, working with other Capabilities and Crafts instinctively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including media, creators and internal client teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a team of Account Managers and Account Executives, providing guidance and mentorship, while also acting as an escalation point to support the team in resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with integrated teams across Ogilvy, including social media and influencer marketing, to spot opportunities and align on campaigns and projects, where relevant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of creativity, collaboration, and innovation within the agency and among the account management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact for mid-senior clients, managing communication and expectations throughout the project lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaign materials, including press releases and assets, are delivered to a high standard and align with the client&#39;s messaging and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular client meetings and status updates to review project progress and discuss any changes or adjustments needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement measurement strategies, as required, to evaluate campaign effectiveness and report on ROI to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, balancing competing priorities and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion inclusiveness, diversity, and equity in all aspects of work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, ensuring a relevant and fresh approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we help you Thrive:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt; 25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to own the systems, structure, and governance that allow our supply chain and fulfilment operation to scale reliably as we grow into a more complex, multi-brand business under the Hims &amp;amp; Hers umbrella.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role sitting at the intersection of operations, supply chain, commercial delivery, and cross-functional execution. You will be responsible for making sure the operation works - not just today, but as we transition to the Hims &amp;amp; Hers brand, treat more conditions, and grow order volumes over the next few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the VP of Operations Assurance at Hims &amp;amp; Hers, leading a small but growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and own the annual supply chain strategy, OKRs, and volume forecasting, translating growth plans into resource, capex, and headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Procurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage end-to-end demand and supply planning, pharmaceutical and vendor relationships, and procurement governance across Rx and non-Rx categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Management and Order Life Cycle: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage Prescribe to Pharmacy process while executing exceptions and meeting appropriate SLA’s.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Patient Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Own courier strategy, carrier SLA management, and the delivery experience function as a retention lever.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost &amp;amp; COGS:&lt;/strong&gt; Own fulfilment cost per order and shipping targets, identifying and delivering initiatives to reduce COGS and wastage across the operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment Engineering &amp;amp; Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the roadmap for fulfilment systems (PMR, WMS, ERP) across our pharmacy and warehouse operations, partnering with engineering to deliver and govern them reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Control: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage IC related responsibilities including day to day but also month and quarter close while ensuring appropriate accounting and compliance measures to meet accuracy commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Launches:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead supply chain input into new product and brand launches, coordinating across Commercial, Clinical, and Growth as we expand under Hims &amp;amp; Hers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Org Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and grow a small team from day one, hiring key roles and building a high-accountability culture as the operation scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced operations leader who thrives in high-growth environments where the pace is fast and the problems are genuinely complex. You know how to build structure without creating bureaucracy, and how to hold a high bar on execution without slowing the business down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are as comfortable in the weeds of a supply chain model or a fulfilment systems conversation as you are presenting a strategy to senior stakeholders. You are commercially sharp, operationally rigorous, and a natural cross-functional partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are excited by the challenge of scaling an operation that is already moving quickly - bringing the systems, governance, and team capability needed to support a more complex, multi-brand business as Eucalyptus grows within the Hims &amp;amp; Hers portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–12 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in supply chain, operations, or a related function, with at least 3–4 years in a director or head-of level role with a team behind you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning end-to-end supply chain or fulfilment operations at scale - ideally in a high-growth, high-volume environment (e.g. e-commerce, health, consumer goods, mobility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and manage supplier and vendor relationships across complex, multi-category supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen - able to own COGS targets, model cost initiatives, and communicate financial impact clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with product and engineering teams to define and deliver fulfilment system requirements &amp;amp; transformations (e.g. WMS, ERP, order management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional product and category launches from an operations perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills - able to hire, develop, and performance manage a growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management - confident presenting to exec and SLT-level audiences and partnering across commercial, clinical, and finance functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in London, with willingness to travel to Birmingham &amp;amp; Enfield on a regular basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solutions Architect, you&#39;ll demonstrate the value of Planet&#39;s data and services to help organizations within the Western and Northern European regions overcome their earth data challenges. You&#39;ll also collaborate with internal cross-functional teams, including Customer Success, Product Management, and Business Development, to act as the voice of the customer to enhance Planet&#39;s industry offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is passionate about Earth observation and enjoys helping customers get most out of their work. This role will appeal to candidates who don’t mind frequent international travel (primarily around Europe) and are comfortable working in the defense and intelligence sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in France or the United Kingdom. This role requires frequent international travel up to 50%. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver presentations and product demonstrations highlighting technical capabilities of Planet’s platform and our ability to fulfill customer’s business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create relationships with customers’ technical and management staff as a trusted advisor to their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an advisor to the customer to recommend a solutions architecture that fits their business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the response to tenders, RFI’s and RFP’s proposals with respect to product/solution information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your sales team colleagues to determine account development plans and execute a strategy to engage customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal cross-functional teams including Customer Success, Product Management, and Business Development to act as the voice of the customer, assist with RFP and RFI preparation and submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attain quarterly and annual sales and operational objectives assigned by management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Planet’s Defense and Intelligence needs to Sales leadership, in communicating forecasts, pipeline opportunities, deal reviews, data in CRM tools, and customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to key executive Government stakeholders within the Western and Northern Europe Regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a mentor to team members and lead training to drive their development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in supporting the Defense community within the European region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have the ability to obtain and maintain a security clearance for meeting with regional customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally up to 50%, primarily around Europe and the United States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with GIS and Remote Sensing users within the Defense industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in IMINT, ISR, and related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with QGIS, SocetGXP, ArcGIS, GDAL and other common geospatial software packages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to successfully communicate and coordinate with international customers &amp;amp; sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and proactive working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask, prioritize and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to program with Python to process imagery, manipulate vector data, interact with APIs and build data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run workshops or training sessions with users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;May 18, 2026 by 11:59p / 23:59 CET (Central European Time)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is undergoing a significant transformation in Europe, including establishing a new satellite manufacturing hub in Berlin and rapidly scaling its EMEA workforce. We are seeking the most senior People Team leader in the region, a Director of People Business Partners, to own the strategic priorities and highest-stakes people decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role translates Planet&#39;s global people strategy for regional execution, surfaces critical local insights, and serves as the essential liaison between EMEA and US People leadership to ensure global programs are adapted for European realities. The ideal candidate will operate with high autonomy and bring senior HR judgment, having built people infrastructure in Europe previously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, in-office position based in our Haarlem, Berlin or London office 5 days per week. The role reports to the VP, People Business Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior People Team leader in EMEA — owning the regional people strategy, representing the function to business leaders across the region, and ensuring that every aspect of the employee lifecycle operates with the same rigor and intentionality in Europe as it does in the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General oversight for the people team including People Business Partners, Talent Partners and People Operations Partners in EMEA, providing the coaching, prioritization, and strategic context they need to operate at their highest level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution of global People Team initiatives in EMEA — including performance management, pay transparency compliance ahead of EU regulatory deadlines, leadership competency framework rollout, and HRIS migration — adapting each for European legal, cultural, and operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help lead the people strategy for the Berlin manufacturing hub buildout — including organizational design, workforce planning, leadership team development, and the cultural integration of a new manufacturing workforce into Planet’s engineering-driven culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary relay between EMEA Leadership Team and the People leadership team in the United States — ensuring that regional context informs global decisions, surfacing risks and opportunities that are not visible from headquarters, and advocating for EMEA needs in resource allocation and program prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition to ensure the EMEA recruiting engine is aligned with workforce plans — providing the org design context, compensation guidance, and hiring manager readiness that recruiters need to close candidates effectively in a competitive European talent market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Operations to ensure seamless operational execution for EMEA employees — including entity compliance, payroll coordination, benefits administration, and onboarding workflows that meet German and broader European requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the most complex and sensitive employee relations matters in EMEA — including performance management, restructuring, and terminations, utilizing deep knowledge of European labor law and the judgment to navigate situations where business drivers and legal compliance may not align.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the organizational and cultural connective tissue that makes Planet’s EMEA workforce feel like a genuine part of the company — not a satellite office. This means designing cross-site collaboration practices, advocating for equitable access to development and advancement opportunities, and ensuring that the Berlin team develops its own identity while remaining tightly connected to Planet’s mission and values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive HR/People experience, with at least 5 years in a senior People Business Partner or HR leadership role supporting European operations at a scaling technology or manufacturing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in European employment compliance including works council engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up or significantly scaling a European operation — including entity establishment, localized employment practices, and integrating a new-geography workforce into a US-headquartered company culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate as the senior People leader in a region, making high-stakes decisions with autonomy and communicating outcomes to headquarters leadership with clarity and confidence. Experience managing and developing People Business Partners — coaching them on stakeholder influence, organizational diagnosis, and the transition from reactive problem-solving to proactive strategic partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid organizational design and workforce planning capabilities — you can look at a growing EMEA operation and translate the business plan into an org structure, role architecture, and hiring sequence that makes sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity and make decisions with incomplete information — particularly in cross-cultural, multi-jurisdiction environments where the “right” answer requires balancing legal requirements, cultural context, business priorities, and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving performance management, compensation, and talent review processes in European markets — including familiarity with EU pay transparency regulations and how to prepare managers for compensation conversations in a compliance-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership style that embodies proactive execution and ownership — you establish clarity, define decision rights, prioritize ruthlessly, and push initiatives to conclusion rather than waiting for direction from headquarters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in aerospace, satellite, defense, or precision manufacturing environments where compliance complexity (export control, ITAR, security clearances) adds a layer of operational rigor to every people decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building a People function — including knowledge of the European talent market, local employer landscape, and the practical realities of scaling a team in the city.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying AI-enabled tools or processes within an HR function — not just awareness, but hands-on involvement in evaluating, implementing, and driving adoption of technology that changes how HR work gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background that includes organizational development, change management, or management consulting — demonstrating the ability to diagnose organizational health, design interventions, and facilitate executive alignment on talent strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a company through a significant growth stage in its European operations — such as first entity establishment, first works council formation, major facility launch, or rapid headcount scaling from under 50 to 200+ employees in a single geography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;August 17, 2026 by 11:59p / 23:59 CET (Central European Time)&lt;/p&gt;
