&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you&lt;/strong&gt;. Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We&#39;re not just leading the market;&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re creating it. We&#39;re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We&#39;re driven,&amp;nbsp;ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn&#39;t stand still, where you can put your&amp;nbsp;ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead an engineering team responsible for the backend&amp;nbsp;platform powering one of the Netherlands&#39; largest automotive marketplaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll lead a team of approximately 5-6 engineers (currently supported by external engineers during an ongoing&amp;nbsp;platform modernization). The team owns the core backend services that power the entire platform, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Vehicle data ingestion from hundreds of external providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Backend services and business logic powering the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Data matching, validation, enrichment and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Search ranking and listing lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Click tracking, billing logic and fraud/bot protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Platform reliability, operational excellence and incident management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The team is currently modernizing its backend platform, migrating from a legacy PHP/Scala stack to Java on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Lead, coach and develop a high-performing engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Product to define priorities and successfully deliver the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Drive technical excellence, engineering quality and operational maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Lead architecture and technical discussions across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Establish strong operational practices, including on-call processes, incident management and post-incident reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Improve system reliability, scalability and performance for a business-critical platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Coordinate complex initiatives involving multiple engineering teams and external dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Foster a strong engineering culture focused on ownership, collaboration and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Contribute to engineering-wide initiatives across AutoScout24 Group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Engineering Productivity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Operate at a high level of efficiency using modern AI-assisted development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Coach engineers on adopting AI to improve software quality and delivery speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Act as a role model for effective AI usage across engineering and leadership activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to integrate AI throughout the software development lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Support the team&#39;s AI maturity and adoption as part of its ongoing transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Java (primary language)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Scala (legacy services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;PHP (being phased out)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Event-driven architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Distributed backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience leading software engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Strong prior experience as a hands-on software engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience building and operating large-scale backend or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Strong background in object-oriented programming (preferably Java)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience leading architecture and technical decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience introducing and running operational excellence practices, including on-call rotations, incident&amp;nbsp;response and postmortems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to deliver complex cross-team initiatives with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Passion for coaching engineers and building high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Experience driving adoption of modern AI development practices within engineering teams is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a seasoned Enterprise Sales Executive to reinforce our leadership in the SaaS machine data analytics space. As an Enterprise Sales Executive, you will be a key member of our sales organization, responsible for driving revenues within your assigned territory. We’re looking for software sales executives who have deep experience opening mid and large enterprise accounts. We seek individuals who are driven to be a top performer in sales, helping make Sumo Logic the next big machine data analytics success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the sales-cycle including lead generation, qualification and other deliverables for closing deals while consistently delivering on aggressive sales goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand accounts’ needs and effectively communicate how the Sumo Logic service will meet those needs while ensuring 100% satisfaction with all customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timely and insightful input back to other corporate functions, particularly engineering, product management and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver accurate forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with product demos using web tools to prospects and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunt and aggressively prospect new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need From You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years consistent quota over achievement in an Enterprise Software Sales role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling an enterprise B2B software application. Ideally, you will have sold an on-demand/SaaS. Security or IT Infrastructure Management solution to a technical audience (IT Heads / DevOps / Security Operations, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of developing a greenfield territory, adding logos in an Enterprise Software space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth, rapidly evolving technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good Sales DNA and sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamwork and excellent communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sumo Logic, Inc. helps make the digital world secure, fast, and reliable by unifying critical security and operational data through its Intelligent Operations Platform. Built to address the increasing complexity of modern cybersecurity and cloud operations challenges, we empower digital teams to move from reaction to readiness—combining agentic AI-powered SIEM and log analytics into a single platform to detect, investigate, and resolve modern challenges. Customers around the world rely on Sumo Logic for trusted insights to protect against security threats, ensure reliability, and gain powerful insights into their digital environments. For more information, visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.sumologic.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.sumologic.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1763582776811000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2tkPOBgFpGkG4SEdY6I_TY&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;www.sumologic.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumologic.com/privacy-statement/&quot;&gt;Sumo Logic Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Employees will be responsible for complying with applicable federal privacy laws and regulations, as well as organizational policies related to data protection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation varies based on a variety of factors which include (but aren’t limited to) role level, skills and competencies, qualifications, knowledge, location, and experience. In addition to base pay, certain roles are eligible to participate in our bonus or commission plans, as well as our benefits offerings, and equity awards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy, you will shape the economics behind our global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit company, active in 17 countries across 3 continents. You will shape how millions of customers experience our product, driving one of the company’s most impactful levers of growth: pricing and discounts. Challenges you’ll solve include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is the right price positioning in each of our markets?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we acquire customers more cost-efficiently?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we design incentives that encourage customers to spend more with HelloFresh?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we leverage AI tooling to arrive at pricing insights and solutions faster than ever before?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be part of the Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy Team, shaping pricing and discount strategy across our full global portfolio which includes our core brand, HelloFresh, as well as: Factor, GreenChef, EveryPlate, Chef&#39;s Plate, and Youfoodz. You’ll work closely with stakeholders from multiple countries and teams such as Product, Marketing Analytics, and Paid Marketing — making this a unique opportunity to combine strategic thinking, analytical depth, and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape market strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor performance and competitor landscapes across our key markets, and translate insights into actionable price &amp;amp; discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run and scale experiments: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, align, and execute A/B tests that validate new pricing and promotional approaches, and ensure learnings are rigorously captured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own key initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end responsibility for selected projects — from framing the problem and aligning stakeholders, to delivering impact through execution and tracking results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build frameworks &amp;amp; playbooks: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop best practices, toolkits, and scalable approaches that improve how we set prices and run promotions across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize processes with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Pricing Analytics and Product to adapt AI use cases within our pricing and discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel (SQL is a plus) with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for exploring opportunities to leverage AI-based workflow tools to optimize internal processes and improve speed to insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
