&lt;p&gt;Als Head of Product Marketing übernimmst Du strategische Verantwortung für unsere Produktentwicklung und unser Go-to-Market. Deine Hauptziele sind Wachstum und Zufriedenheit unserer Nutzer zu erhöhen sowie neue Produkte in den Markt zu bringen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du bist zentraler Schnittstelle zwischen unseren Product- und Tech-Teams und dem Markt: Du beeinflusst aktiv die Produktstrategie und Roadmap und begleitest den gesamten Lifecycle — von der Entwicklung neuer Features bis zum Launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du übersetzt komplexe Produktlogiken in klare Positionierungen und Botschaften für den deutschen Markt und stellst sicher, dass unsere Lösungen beim richtigen Segment ankommen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du entwickelst und steuerst Go-to-Market-Strategien für Doctolib Produkte und koordinierst dabei eng mit Marketing, Sales und Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du managst Product- &amp;amp; Feature-Releases end-to-end und sorgst für deren erfolgreiche Markteinführung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Als Stimme unserer Nutzer:innen&amp;nbsp;analysierst du Marktsignale entlang der Customer Journey, übersetzt User Insights in konkrete Produktanforderungen und arbeitest so kontinuierlich an der Verbesserung unseres Product-Market-Fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du analysierst Markttrends und Wettbewerb, um strategische Chancen zu identifizieren und in Produktentscheidungen einfließen zu lassen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du verfolgst gemeinsam mit anderen Teams regulatorische und technische Rahmenbedingungen und gestaltest aktiv ein Umfeld für nutzerfreundliche, marktgerechte Lösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Du bist der festen Überzeugung, dass Du genau das mitbringst, was es für die Position braucht? Dann ermutigen wir Dich, Dich zu bewerben. Selbst wenn Du nicht jede Anforderung erfüllst, bist Du vielleicht genau die/der richtige zukünftige Doctoliber:in für diese oder andere Stellen!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Um Teil unseres Teams zu werden, bringst Du Folgendes mit:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du hast mindestens 10 Jahre Berufserfahrung als Product Marketing Manager:in, Product Manager:in oder mit einem Hintergrund in der Top-Tier-Managementberatung mit klarem Bezug zu Produktstrategie und -entwicklung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du hast nachweislich eng mit Engineering- und Product-Teams zusammengearbeitet und bist in der Lage, technische Konzepte schnell zu durchdringen und in marktrelevante Botschaften zu übersetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du hast eine ausgeprägte, strukturierte und analytische Denkweise und arbeitest datenbasiert — sei es bei der Auswertung von User Research, Marktdaten oder Produktkennzahlen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du bist in der Lage, Prioritäten zu setzen, Ressourcen sinnvoll zu allokieren und Projekte strukturiert zu führen, um komplexe Go-to-Market-Strategien effektiv zu entwickeln, zu planen und umzusetzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du bist erfahren im Management mehrerer seniorer Stakeholder und weißt, wie du Produkt-, Vertriebs- und Marketingperspektiven zusammenbringst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Du verfügst über ausgezeichnete verbale und schriftliche Kommunikationsfähigkeiten auf Deutsch und Englisch (jeweils mindestens C1-Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Besonders interessant sind für uns außerdem:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Erfahrung in einem Scale-up- oder wachstumsstarken Technologieunternehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Erfahrung im Medtech- oder Healthtech-Bereich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir Dir bieten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein von Doctolib gesponsertes Deutschlandticket, wenn Du aus dem Büro oder im Hybridmodus arbeitest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Krankenversicherung mit tollen Zusatzleistungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an Doctolibs langfristigem Mitarbeiterbeteiligungsprogramm DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 Urlaubstage + 1 Tag zusätzlich für jedes volle Beschäftigungs-Kalenderjahr (max. 30 Tage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Möglichkeit, bis zu 10 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge (bAV) mit einem Arbeitgeberzuschuss von 40 % (15 % während der Probezeit)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Das Doctolib Parent Care Programm, das einen Monat Elternzeit extra u.v.m. enthält&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Mental Health- und Coaching-Sessions über einen externen Partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusätzlich zu gesunden Snacks und einem regelmäßigen Frühstücksbuffet, bieten wir Essensgutscheine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein gefördertes Sportangebot mit unserem Partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Für pflegende Betreuungspersonen und Beschäftigte mit Behinderungen gibt es ein Angebot, das flexiblere Arbeitszeiten, zusätzliche Freistellung aus medizinischen Gründen und psychologische Unterstützung beinhaltet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Der Interviewprozess&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referenzen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Festanstellung&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vollzeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeitsort Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 Tage Homeoffice / Woche&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startdatum ab sofort &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben, unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um Cha&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ncengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;hier&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Website Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the analytical backbone of our online shop. You know how to generate not just reports, but real growth levers from vast amounts of data. You work directly at the interface between Business, Marketing, and Product, ensuring that every decision is based on valid data. At IONOS, you will actively help shape the future of the hosting and cloud business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Strategy &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You are responsible for the holistic analysis of the customer journey in our online shop and define the KPIs by which we measure our success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; You deliver more than just raw numbers—you provide &quot;actionable insights.&quot; You identify friction points in the funnel and derive concrete optimization recommendations for E-commerce Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Personalization:&lt;/strong&gt; You act as a sparring partner for our Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) team, provide statistically sound support for A/B tests, and evaluate their impact on CLV (Customer Lifetime Value).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Together with Data Engineering, you ensure precise tracking (client- &amp;amp; server-side) and maintain the highest data quality in a post-cookie era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; You prepare complex analyses for management (department heads) so that they serve as a well-founded basis for decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have several years (5+) of experience in the field of Web Analytics or Digital Analytics, ideally in a high-traffic e-commerce environment or with a SaaS provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are intimately familiar with common tools (e.g., Adobe Analytics, Google Analytics 4, Matomo). SQL is a standard for you, and we require experience with BI tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep understanding of attribution models, customer journeys, and web technologies (HTML, JS, CSS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are not satisfied with the status quo. You question data critically and have the drive to proactively improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can communicate complex issues precisely and convincingly in both German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model with Home office option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations, a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a modern e-commerce division responsible for the international online presence of currently 7 brands within the IONOS Group, making it one of the most important sales channels for our company. We work both in agile, cross-functional, and interdisciplinary teams, as well as in combination with agile project management for larger, complex initiatives and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy taking responsibility and want to help shape the online presence of tomorrow with us, you are exactly right here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Product Owner, you will take end-to-end responsibility for a product area of our websites and online shops or for a brand within the IONOS Group, collaborating with cross-functional experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the person responsible for the conversion rate, you will continuously analyze and interpret user flows on the portal and in the checkout funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor the key KPIs of our main websites and online shops, providing analysis and reports for management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will create and prioritize your backlog of improvements based on user feedback, business goals, and market insights, and align this with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct methodological analyses, such as market and competitive assessments, to identify user needs, trends, and opportunities for further development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to translate complex user and business requirements from various stakeholders in the company into seamless workflows and conceptual ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely in cross-functional collaboration and align with all relevant interfaces (development, technology, agencies, product management, product marketing, sales, customer service, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with current UX design trends and are interested in innovative concepts. You can effectively communicate and advocate for new ideas and concepts within the team and among our stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a passionate Product Owner and know what you want. The needs of our users drive you. Your foundation for success is a successful degree or equivalent education. You are familiar with the pros and cons of classical and agile methodologies through several years of practical experience, ideally in software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring the right mix of creativity and entrepreneurial thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are characterized by analytical thinking, a lot of initiative, commitment, courage, and a structured but pragmatic approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in working with stakeholders, as well as in creating epics and user stories, and in managing and prioritizing the product backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaboratively develop the product vision with stakeholders and bring it to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for digital innovation and a strong interest in new technologies and trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to succeed in a fast-paced, dynamic environment and quickly adapt to changing priorities and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally, you are known for your quality awareness, willingness to perform, and initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy technical topics and digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in tools like G-Suite, Microsoft Office, Atlassian/JIRA, or Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in an international company, so you have no problems communicating effectively in written and spoken English and German!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model with Home office option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations, a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, you will collaborate with different teams as part of the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services, and hosting services. We offer you a perspective in one of the most future-proof industries. We are characterized by open work structures, a first-name culture, and flat hierarchies with an unparalleled team spirit. We firmly believe that job and fun are compatible and provide the right environment for it. With constant growth, we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and let&#39;s grow together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager DC Software Development, you are responsible for leading and coordinating our software development team in Karlsruhe, which specializes in the purchase, development, and optimization of software solutions for our data center and bare metal teams. You will play a key role in shaping our technology roadmap and ensuring that our software infrastructure supports our teams&#39; work in the best possible way while meeting the highest standards for performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership and Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, motivate, and develop a team of highly skilled software developers and system engineers. Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop the strategic direction of data center &amp;amp; bare metal software development in collaboration with your product owners and other stakeholders. Identify and integrate new technologies and trends into our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the entire software development cycle from requirements analysis through design, implementation, testing to deployment and maintenance. Ensure adherence to schedules and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure the technical quality and architecture of our software solutions. Make informed decisions regarding design principles, coding standards, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with data center and bare metal operations and other relevant teams to ensure seamless integration and smooth operation of our data center applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze and optimize the performance of our software to continuously improve the efficiency and reliability of the data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and mitigate potential risks of our applications and during the implementation or introduction of new solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or comparable qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Several years of experience in a leadership position in software development, ideally in a data center or similarly technically complex environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Profound knowledge of modern software development methods (e.g., Agile, Scrum) and programming languages (e.g., Python, Ruby on Rails).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong affinity for current AI trends and their practical application to optimize business processes and create innovative products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud and DC Technologies:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive understanding of cloud architectures, virtualization, containers (Docker, Kubernetes), and infrastructure-as-code principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic understanding of network architecture and firewall configurations is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in designing scalable, highly available, and robust software systems for data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication and presentation skills in German and English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills and a solution-oriented working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Ability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work effectively in a dynamic, interdisciplinary team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;You will actively shape the digital experience of our IONOS shop—from the creative idea to final implementation. You don’t just think visually; you think analytically: your concepts are based on data, user needs, and clear conversion goals. You combine conceptual thinking with a strong eye for design, ensuring a modern, user-centric, and high-performance appearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In our agile, interdisciplinary team, you will work closely with Product Owners, Development, and Data with one clear objective: to continuously improve the visual quality, usability, and conversion of our digital touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design new landing pages, shop funnels, and other digital touchpoints with a strong focus on brand and design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly ideate and design new concepts for shop optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end responsibility for specific product areas of our online shop and/or an IONOS Group brand, collaborating with cross-functional experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams and coordinate with relevant stakeholders (Development, Tech, Agencies, Product Management, Product Marketing, Sales, Customer Service, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize UX concepts, visuals, interactions, and motion designs for our international shop segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance visual creativity, user perspective, and conversion goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of our group-wide Design System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute proactively, bring in new ideas, and occasionally test &quot;moonshot&quot; concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in Digital Art Direction, Visual Design, and UI/UX Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of layout, visual hierarchy, typography, animation, composition, and digital aesthetics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with design and motion tools such as Figma or similar programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and experience in using AI tools within the design or content process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An independent, structured way of working with high quality standards and strong execution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoyment of cross-functional collaboration and an open mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the creative direction of projects and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex requirements from UX, Business, and Tech into clear, consistent visual concepts and layouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model with Home office option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations, a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
