&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Revenue Insights Analyst, you will play a pivotal role in driving our revenue by analysing complex data sets to uncover actionable insights and growth opportunities. Working closely with cross-functional teams, you’ll identify and communicate key revenue drivers, develop recommendations for optimisation, and support strategic initiatives with data-driven guidance. Your work will directly impact our business outcomes, helping us stay competitive and agile in a dynamic market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Tasks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Insights Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses of revenue streams, customer behaviours, and market trends to identify key drivers of growth and potential areas of improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use statistical and analytical techniques to build models that predict revenue trends and pinpoint growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly monitor and report on key revenue metrics, providing insights on variances and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Revenue Optimisation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate insights into actionable strategies that align with organisational goals, driving revenue growth across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, design, and recommend improvements to pricing, marketing, sales, and customer experience initiatives based on data findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Marketing, and Product teams to develop data-backed strategies that target customer acquisition, retention, and lifetime value optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Communication &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and present reports and dashboards that provide clear visibility into revenue performance and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver insights and recommendations to stakeholders, making complex data accessible and actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly update leadership on emerging trends, risks, and areas of opportunity for revenue optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date on industry best practices and data analysis techniques to refine our approach to revenue insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and propose new data sources, tools, and methodologies to improve analytical accuracy and relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data engineers and IT to ensure data quality and integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a similar role, focusing on data analysis, business intelligence, or revenue optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to turn data insights into strategic recommendations that drive revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with a knack for making data accessible to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with proficiency in data analysis tools like SQL, Python, R, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualisation tools (e.g., Tableau, Power BI) to create compelling and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM, financial forecasting, and business intelligence tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the use of AI and / or Machine Leaning to optimise outcomes is a benefit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Economics, Statistics, Data Science, or a related field (advantageous, non essential)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent / native-level (C1+) English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing and reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
